            <p>Female Genital Warts. Condylomata acuminata in females may be found in the anal or genital area, including the vagina or labia majora, as well as on the internal surfaces of the vagina and the anus. <ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://dermnetnz.org/images">DermNet New Zealand</ext-link></p>
