          <caption>
            <p>Condylomata Acuminata. Genital warts (condyloma acuminata) are the clinical manifestations of a sexually transmitted infection (STI) caused by some types of human papillomavirus (HPV). Contributed by&#x000a0;S Bhimji, MD</p>
          </caption>
          <graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="condylomata__acuminatum" position="float" orientation="portrait"/>
